usage: ladon theorem [-h] {plan,materialize,replay,extract,lineage} ...

Plan, materialize, and independently replay Lean theorem capsules.

positional arguments:
  {plan,materialize,replay,extract,lineage}
    plan                Resolve a theorem exactly and write a complete
                        extraction plan.
    materialize         Materialize a validated plan outside its target
                        repository.
    replay              Verify a capsule with Lean in a fresh replay
                        directory.
    extract             Plan and materialize one theorem, optionally verifying
                        it.
    lineage             Query exact compiled theorem dependencies from the
                        project-local SQLite index.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
